#
# Network roles of the appliance, read by /usr/libexec/fps/fps-mgmt-net at boot.
# The management interface is the Ethernet device with this MAC address. Empty
# selects the Ethernet device with the lowest PCI address, which is the first NIC
# of the VM. Write the MAC in lower case with colons, for example 52:54:00:12:34:01.
FPS_MGMT_MAC=
